WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.867
Open Voice in the editor sidebar

00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:10.229
Change the primary language

00:00:10.229 --> 00:00:15.431
Pick a secondary language the agent can switch to

00:00:15.431 --> 00:00:22.107
Add more languages callers may speak

00:00:22.107 --> 00:00:27.430
Filter voices by provider and tag

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:31.949
Click a voice to select it and hear its preview

00:00:31.949 --> 00:00:40.694
Clone a voice from a short MP3 sample

00:00:40.694 --> 00:00:46.294
Set the voice speed and play it back

00:00:46.294 --> 00:00:50.863
Click Save

00:00:50.863 --> 00:00:53.870
Saved: the next call uses Meera in Hindi at 0.9x
